      "description": "Day HTML/CSS preview of compact canvas navigation. Native focus is handled by MenuKeyboard, not browser focus.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Game\"><button class=\"ds-nav-button\">Pause</button><button class=\"ds-nav-button\">Fast</button><button class=\"ds-nav-button ds-nav-menu\">Menu</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:8px;width:367px;padding:8px 0;background:#FCF0ED}.ds-nav-button{font:600 23px Quicksand,sans-serif;color:#302A28;background:#FCFBFA;border:1.64px solid #302A28;border-radius:16px;min-height:43.89px;padding:2px 12px;box-shadow:.82px 3.12px 0 #302A28}.ds-nav-menu{margin-left:auto}.ds-nav-button:hover{cursor:pointer}.ds-nav-button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #302A28;outline-offset:3.51px}.ds-nav-button:active{transform:translateY(2.34px);box-shadow:.82px .78px 0 #302A28;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(48,42,40,.07),rgba(48,42,40,.07))}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected node — native preview",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "planet",
      "description": "Day Static HTML/CSS preview of a selected green canvas node at r=20px; the actual count scales through the game camera.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-node\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Selected green node, 40 units\"><span class=\"ds-node-count\">40</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-node{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:#302A28;box-shadow:1.4px 2.8px 0 rgba(48,42,40,.13),2px 4px 0 2.4px rgba(48,42,40,.06);outline:2px solid rgba(254,210,63,.7);outline-offset:5px}.ds-node::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:35.6px;height:35.6px;bottom:3.3px;border-radius:50%;background:#6CD6A0}.ds-node::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:10.8px;top:6.8px;width:7.2px;height:7.2px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.4)}.ds-node-count{position:relative;z-index:1;color:#302A28;font:600 15.3px Quicksand,sans-serif}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Night secondary button — native preview",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary-night",
      "description": "HTML/CSS preview of the Night board, cream label, light outline, and fixed dark depth at W=390, H=844.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-night-button-canvas\"><button class=\"ds-night-secondary\">Settings</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-night-button-canvas{padding:12px;background:#1D232B}.ds-night-secondary{font:600 23px Quicksand,sans-serif;color:#F4EFE8;background:#29323D;border:1.64px solid #93A1AF;border-radius:16px;min-height:50.64px;padding:8px 24px;box-shadow:.82px 3.12px 0 #302A28,1.64px 4.68px 0 rgba(48,42,40,.09)}.ds-night-secondary:hover{cursor:pointer}.ds-night-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #F4EFE8;outline-offset:3.51px}.ds-night-secondary:active{transform:translateY(2.34px);box-shadow:.82px .78px 0 #302A28;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(48,42,40,.07),rgba(48,42,40,.07))}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Appearance choices — native preview",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "appearance-night",
      "description": "HTML/CSS preview of saved Night selection and enabled abstract backgrounds. The browser sample does not operate native preferences.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-appearance\"><div class=\"ds-appearance-options\"><button class=\"ds-appearance-mode\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Day</button><button class=\"ds-appearance-mode ds-appearance-selected\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Night</button></div><label class=\"ds-appearance-check\">Abstract backgrounds<input class=\"ds-appearance-input\" type=\"checkbox\" checked /></label></div>",
      "css": ".ds-appearance{width:312px;padding:24px 16px;background:#1D232B;color:#F4EFE8;font:600 19px Quicksand,sans-serif}.ds-appearance-options{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-bottom:54px}.ds-appearance-mode{width:136.5px;min-height:63.3px;border:1.64px solid #93A1AF;border-radius:16px;background:#29323D;color:#F4EFE8;font:600 23px Quicksand,sans-serif;box-shadow:.82px 3.12px 0 #302A28}.ds-appearance-selected{background:#FED23F;color:#302A28}.ds-appearance-check{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;min-height:59.08px}.ds-appearance-input{width:23.63px;height:23.63px;accent-color:#FED23F}.ds-appearance-mode:hover,.ds-appearance-input:hover{cursor:pointer}.ds-appearance-mode:focus-visible,.ds-appearance-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #F4EFE8;outline-offset:3.51px}.ds-appearance-mode:active{transform:translateY(2.34px);box-shadow:.82px .78px 0 #302A28;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(48,42,40,.07),rgba(48,42,40,.07))}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Speed control — native preview",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "speed-control",
      "description": "Static HTML/CSS preview of the native Day speed card at W=390, H=844, showing saved 0.5x. Focus and press styling illustrate canvas feedback; this preview does not change speed or produce haptics.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-speed-card\"><div class=\"ds-speed-rail\"><div class=\"ds-speed-progress\"></div><span class=\"ds-speed-stop ds-speed-filled\" style=\"left:0.0000%\"></span><span class=\"ds-speed-stop ds-speed-filled\" style=\"left:8.3333%\"></span><span class=\"ds-speed-stop ds-speed-filled\" style=\"left:16.6667%\"></span><span class=\"ds-speed-stop ds-speed-filled\" style=\"left:25.0000%\"></span><span class=\"ds-speed-stop ds-speed-filled\" style=\"left:33.3333%\"></span><span class=\"ds-speed-stop\" style=\"left:41.6667%\"></span><span class=\"ds-speed-stop ds-speed-normal\" style=\"left:50.0000%\"></span><span class=\"ds-speed-stop\" style=\"left:58.3333%\"></span><span class=\"ds-speed-stop\" style=\"left:66.6667%\"></span><span class=\"ds-speed-stop\" style=\"left:75.0000%\"></span><span class=\"ds-speed-stop\" style=\"left:83.3333%\"></span><span class=\"ds-speed-stop\" style=\"left:91.6667%\"></span><span class=\"ds-speed-stop\" style=\"left:100.0000%\"></span><button class=\"ds-speed-handle\" aria-label=\"Speed 0.5 times\">0.5x</button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-speed-card{width:366.6px;height:55.704px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:16px;background:#FCF0ED}.ds-speed-rail{position:relative;width:280.8px;height:6.24px;border-radius:3.12px;background:#302A28}.ds-speed-progress{position:absolute;left:0;top:1.56px;width:33.3333%;height:3.12px;border-radius:1.56px;background:#FED23F}.ds-speed-stop{position:absolute;top:50%;width:5.46px;height:5.46px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);border-radius:50%;background:#302A28}.ds-speed-stop::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:2.73px;height:2.73px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);border-radius:50%;background:#FCF0ED}.ds-speed-filled::after{background:#FED23F}.ds-speed-normal{width:8.58px;height:8.58px}.ds-speed-handle{position:absolute;left:33.3333%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:78px;height:45.12024px;background:#FED23F;color:#302A28;border:1.56px solid #302A28;border-radius:16px;font:600 19px Quicksand,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 2.532px 0 rgba(48,42,40,.16)}.ds-speed-handle:hover{cursor:grab}.ds-speed-card:focus-within{outline:2px solid #302A28;outline-offset:3.51px}.ds-speed-handle:focus-visible{outline:none}.ds-speed-handle:active{width:81.12px;height:48.46248px;cursor:grabbing}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "",
    "overview": "Warm paper, rounded ink lines, and restrained yellow actions make the strategy easy to read and operate. Night mode keeps the same layout with dark surfaces and cream menu text. Shallow depth makes buttons and nodes feel tangible while the board stays quiet. Fraunces titles give menus character; Quicksand carries choices and numbers.\n\nThis documents the implemented libGDX canvas, scoped to the existing game's interface refinement. Visual reference: [Inkwell Stars](https://inkwellgames.com/games/stars/tutorial).",
    "keyCharacteristics": [],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "Do use plain action labels and show costs before a player spends units.",
      "Do keep the board clear enough to follow routes and read node counts.",
      "Do preserve language coverage, colorblind textures, and visible keyboard focus.",
      "Do keep appearance choices saved, with Day and plain backgrounds as the defaults.",
      "Do check affected states on desktop and phone before release."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add competing primary menu actions or repeated explanations.",
      "Don't add perpetual decorative motion or manipulative progression prompts.",
      "Don't use light menu text on yellow or faction-colored faces.",
      "Don't replace the native canvas conventions with a generic web or Material interface."
    ]
  }
}
